    prerequisiteCompletedOnMaxDay: 0
  dialogueLines:
  - Tara made it! I was going to propose today but I lost the ring on the beach.
  - Would you help me find it? I hid it near the dunes so she'd never guess...
  - Please — this has to be perfect.
  searchingDialogueLines:
  - Any luck with the ring? I think I dropped it near the dunes.
  - Check the sandy spots away from the water. It has to be there!
  turnInDialogueLines:
  - You found it! Oh man, you have no idea what this means.
  - Tara's going to say yes — here, take this star. You earned it.
  completedDialogueLines:
  - Thanks again for the ring. You're part of this story now.
  day2CompletedDialogueLines:
  - Still can't believe you found the ring in time.
  - Tara and I owe you everything.
  day2IncompleteDialogueLines: []
  day3PerfectDialogueLines:
  - Today's the day — we're getting married at the Tiki Hut!
  - You made this whole week perfect. Thank you.
  day3LateDialogueLines:
  - We made it work, even if the timing was tight.
  - Thanks for sticking with us through the week.
  completedDialogueVariants:
  - minDay: 3
    maxDay: 0
    requiredStoryBeat: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f90, type: 2}
    requiredStoryFlag: 
    priority: 100
    lines:
