    lines:
    - We made it work, even if the timing was tight.
    - Thanks for sticking with us through the week.
  day1BlockedDialogueLines:
  - Tomorrow's the big day. Tara and I are finally meeting up on the beach!
  - I can barely sleep — I've got a surprise planned for her.
  day2BlockedDialogueLines:
  - Where is Tara? She was supposed to meet me here...
  - Did she blow me off? I hope she's okay.
  day3BlockedDialogueLines:
  - A guy just can't catch a break this week.
  - Tara never showed up. I don't know what went wrong.
